            <div xml:id="d126-a2">

                <pb facs="0297" n="173" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg173"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 6.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Their excellencies Pao and
                            Li to the commissioners.</hi></head>
                <p>Upon the 1st instant your excellencies left with us at the foreign office a
                    memorandum upon certain treaty modifications. We have carefully considered it,
                    and beg to submit a note in response. We shall he glad to hear how it strikes
                    your excellencies.</p>


                <xi:include href="d126-a2-a1.xml" xpointer="d126-a2-a1"/>
